[22:39:57] INFO        Correction formula: SFR_true = SFR_obs / Gamma_t^m
[22:39:57] INFO            SFR bias index m: 0.5000
[22:39:57] INFO          Rationale: UV-based SFR traces recent SF (< 100 Myr), less affected than cumulative mass
[22:39:57] INFO            Mass bias index n (for comparison): 0.7000
